===== STATUS: success =====
Question: What approaches published in 2023 or later let language models use external tools?

Several approaches published in 2023 enable language models to use external tools. Toolformer is a concurrent method that allows language models to invoke external tools through API calls, specifically Wikipedia APIs (asai2023selfraglearningto pages 7-8). Self-RAG integrates retrieval as a tool during both training and inference, enabling language models to retrieve and generate content through self-reflection (asai2023selfraglearningto pages 7-8). Perplexity.ai represents a production search system that augments language models with external capabilities (asai2023selfraglearningto pages 7-8).

Beyond retrieval-focused approaches, Reflexion is a language agent framework that employs verbal reinforcement learning to enable language models to interact with external environments and tools through action sequences (shinn2023reflexionlanguageagents pages 11-15). ReAct is a related approach that combines reasoning and acting capabilities (shinn2023reflexionlanguageagents pages 11-15). Reflexion has been evaluated on diverse tasks including HumanEval programming, HotPotQA question answering, AlfWorld decision-making, and WebShop e-commerce navigation, demonstrating the breadth of external tool integration (shinn2023reflexionlanguageagents pages 11-15).

These 2023 approaches represent distinct paradigms: retrieval-augmented methods that integrate external knowledge sources, and agent frameworks that enable sequential interaction with complex environments through reasoning and action.

References

1. (asai2023selfraglearningto pages 7-8): Akari Asai, Zeqiu Wu, Yizhong Wang, Avirup Sil, and Hannaneh Hajishirzi. Self-rag: learning to retrieve, generate, and critique through self-reflection. arXiv (Cornell University), Oct 2023. URL: https://doi.org/10.48550/arxiv.2310.11511, doi:10.48550/arxiv.2310.11511. This article has 1088 citations.

2. (shinn2023reflexionlanguageagents pages 11-15): Noah Shinn, Federico Cassano, Ashwin Gopinath, Karthik Narasimhan, and Shunyu Yao. Reflexion: language agents with verbal reinforcement learning. neural information processing systems, Jan 2023. URL: https://doi.org/10.52202/075280-0377, doi:10.52202/075280-0377. This article has 3334 citations.
